    "summary_finding": "Scalar cursor WHERE scheduled_at < 1700000000 drops tied-timestamp rows across page boundaries: enqueued 3 reports at t=1700000000 (ids=[3, 2, 1]), page1 returned [3, 2], page2 returned [], permanently dropping id=[1].",
